cription":"Winner – Renovated Kitchen","year":"23"},{"heading":"HIA Victoria","description":"Winner – Custom Home Under $3m","year":"20"}]}},"__N_SSG":true,"pageProps":{"data":{"page":{"seo":{"title":"For Architects - Haven","description":"","canonical":"https://www.havenconstructions.com.au/for-architects/","openGraph":{"title":"For Architects - Haven","description":"","image":{"url":"","alt":""}},"twitter":{"title":"","description":"","image":{"url":"","alt":""}},"noindex":false,"nofollow":false}},"blocks":[{"type":"section-intro","heading":"Collaboration without compromise","subheading":"For Architects","content":"<p>At Haven, we understand the responsibility of realising architectural design. Our role is simple: to deliver built outcomes that remain true to intent. Every proportion, junction, and material is resolved and executed with precision, maintaining integrity from concept through to completion. Architectural projects rely on alignment between vision and execution, where the smallest decisions define the outcome. We do not reinterpret the design. We realise it, with clarity, discipline and care.</p>\n","cta":false,"image":null,"video":null},{"type":"image","imageCount":"1","imageWidth":"full","caption":false,"captionSecondary":false,"image":{"id":"cG9zdDozNTU=","alt":"","caption":"","sourceUrl":"https://haven.api.jtbadev.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Hero.jpg","width":3864,"height":2576,"blurPlaceholder":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRloAAABXRUJQVlA4IE4AAAAwAgCdASoQAAsAA4BaJZQC7AEPh7bZ4NSwfAD+9pQCAoimVO3haO55SbjG+09sNn+pEVWHrOJMVdb4qV1urf2slA03HQP65nhqjCSAAAA="},"imageSecondary":null,"video":null,"videoSecondary":null},{"type":"section-intro","heading":"Built for architectural collaboration","subheading":"Our Process","content":"<p>We apply deep construction expertise to complex architectural projects, translating conceptual ambition into built form with precision and care. Our team engages with the logic behind the drawings to understand not only what is designed, but why.</p>\n<p>From constrained sites to complex geometries, we resolve challenges through technical clarity and a considered approach to form, scale, and spatial sequencing—ensuring light, volume, and movement are realised as intended.</p>\n<p>From early engagement through to completion, we provide clarity around buildability, methodology, and cost, coordinating consultants, trades, and procurement with discipline and intent. Material selection and construction methodology are treated as integral to the architecture, with a focus on performance, buildability, and longevity—ensuring a final outcome that remains true to the original design vision.</p>\n","cta":false,"image":null,"video":null},{"type":"image-three-column","images":[{"image":{"id":"cG9zdDozNTI=","alt":"","caption":"","sourceUrl":"https://haven.api.jtbadev.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/1-of-3.jpg","width":2859,"height":3482,"blurPlaceholder":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRngAAABXRUJQVlA4IGwAAACQBACdASoQABMAPu1iqU2ppaOiMAgBMB2JYgCdMoMYADwo8uNXELVkIDcBUCAA/uBSdseCkNZ4WeCvqruVsNQ11f7YIjWLWj8SjSMu1dDXDfW2NYgteuDF4oKK/z8h81m/LGRj2h7PEAGgAAA="},"video":false},{"image":{"id":"cG9zdDozNTM=","alt":"","caption":"","sourceUrl":"https://haven.api.jtbadev.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/2-of-3.jpg","width":2577,"height":3864,"blurPlaceholder":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRm4AAABXRUJQVlA4IGIAAABQAwCdASoQABgALrV2u12jqampiYC0SgC3uDdA8xVlIZwEuAD+4bL3iqPIYyp6CtGZIcYCInNQAi6G+JkDEANm0ua9CPcM85052JAMnTtRlzrC0IcpQvTcwHPOGunXr6VAAA=="},"video":false},{"image":{"id":"cG9zdDozNTQ=","alt":"","caption":"","sourceUrl":"https://haven.api.jtbadev.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/3-of-3.jpg","width":2577,"height":3864,"blurPlaceholder":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRnoAAABXRUJQVlA4IG4AAAAwBACdASoQABgAPu1yrU+pp6QiMAgBMB2JYwCo9GBdOLJfaF8Ivl0l/NgA/v0GJzbEJRaXv1A3g/VeLUcv+pgv6E/XeVasdM1JEEc1eaIZMli6/+jj/0VvALGoTvNtht+YB3ZqYvZZatnOimiAAA=="},"video":false}]},{"type":"quote","quote":" Haven bring an extraordinary level of care and precision to every decision. It felt like building with people who understood our vision better than we did.","authorName":"Andrew Grimsdale, Cumulus Studio","image":null},{"type":"list-carousel","heading":"Our collaborators","description":"Haven partners with leading architects and designers to realise ideas with integrity and precision. Our relationships are built on trust, detail, and shared respect for design.","panels":[{"image":{"id":"cG9zdDoyNjc=","alt":"","caption":"","sourceUrl":"https://haven.api.jtbadev.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Our-collaborators-scaled-1.jpg","width":4000,"height":2667,"blurPlaceholder":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRnQAAABXRUJQVlA4IGgAAAAQAgCdASoQAAsAA4BaJQBOgMYO2DQpwSwAAP7YePSOCCWbMJU0l/K/sHO8j9h5tO//bNerVZcj/o5zYJL5FfmNcdbsgrdf03jsTknI2I38YU9wB7lEDzMLPnsYak2x8/MKQvmv9cAAAA=="},"description":false}],"list":[{"label":false,"value":false}]}],"pageData":{"title":"For Architects","parents":[],"featuredImage":false,"colorTheme":"dark","projectData":{"heading":false,"content":false,"mainImage":false,"video":false,"details":[{"label":"Name","value":"For Architects"}],"nextPost":false}},"postType":"Page"}}}